<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Theme Manager</h2><p>Install immutable Theme Package 3.0 ZIP releases, preview them, switch the live theme, or uninstall an inactive theme.</p></div><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/help#theme-sdk">Theme SDK help</a></div>
      <div class="notice"><span>i</span><div><strong>The LMS does not edit or export themes.</strong><br>Theme authors maintain source externally and publish each update as a new version. Installed name + version releases remain side-by-side. Factory Reset is the default theme, not a fallback for unrelated themes.</div></div>
      <div class="toolbar section"><div><h3 style="margin:0">Installed themes</h3><p class="muted small">The filesystem is authoritative. PostgreSQL keeps a rebuildable metadata registry so parent/child relationships and theme status can be presented clearly.</p></div><div class="row-actions"><form action="/admin/themes/resync" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}"><button class="btn btn-soft" type="submit">Re-sync themes</button></form><details><summary class="btn btn-primary">Import theme ZIP</summary><form action="/admin/themes/import" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="card theme-popover-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}"><div class="field"><label>Theme Package 3.0 ZIP</label><input type="file" name="theme_file" accept=".zip,application/zip" required><div class="help">The package is validated and inspected before installation. A repaired theme may reuse the same name and version after the defective installed copy has been uninstalled.</div></div><button class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:10px">Inspect package</button></form></details></div></div>
      {% if theme_registry_out_of_sync %}<div class="notice warning section"><span>!</span><div><strong>Theme registry is out of sync.</strong><br>The filesystem remains authoritative. Use Re-sync themes to rebuild the PostgreSQL metadata index.</div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="table-wrap section"><table><thead><tr><th style="width:44%">Theme</th><th style="width:10%">Version</th><th style="width:12%">Status</th><th class="cell-actions" style="width:34%">Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for themeItem in themes %}<tr><td><div style="padding-left:{{ themeItem.is_child ? '28px' : '0' }}">{% if themeItem.is_child %}<span class="muted" aria-hidden="true">↳ </span>{% endif %}<strong>{{ themeItem.label }}</strong> {% if themeItem.is_parent %}<span class="badge">parent</span>{% endif %}{% if themeItem.is_child %}<span class="badge">child</span>{% endif %}{% if not themeItem.registry_synced %}<span class="badge warn">registry</span>{% endif %}<div class="small muted">{{ themeItem.description }}</div>{% if themeItem.is_child %}<div class="small muted">Child of {{ themeItem.parent_name }} {{ themeItem.parent_version }}</div>{% endif %}{% if themeItem.is_default %}<div class="small muted">Default theme</div>{% endif %}{% if themeItem.palette_warning %}<div class="small"><span class="badge warn">{{ themeItem.palette_count }} palettes</span> <span class="muted">3–5 recommended</span></div>{% endif %}</div></td><td>{{ themeItem.version }}</td><td>{% if themeItem.active %}<span class="badge active-theme">LIVE</span>{% else %}<span class="badge">installed</span>{% endif %}</td><td class="cell-actions" data-no-row-menu="the control that recovers from a broken theme must not itself depend on that theme rendering a menu"><div class="row-actions"><a class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" href="/?theme_preview={{ themeItem.key|urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Preview</a>{% if not themeItem.active %}<form action="/admin/themes/activate" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}"><input type="hidden" name="theme" value="{{ themeItem.key }}"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Activate</button></form>{% endif %}{% if not themeItem.is_default and not themeItem.active %}<form action="/admin/themes/{{ themeItem.key }}/delete" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}"><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" data-confirm="Uninstall this theme release and remove its files?">Uninstall</button></form>{% endif %}</div></td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      <p class="small muted">Theme source is stored on the filesystem. Catto Learning keeps only the selected active-theme identifier in application settings.</p>